y for red cards", "polarity": "did", "targets": ["number of games", "covariate"], "confidence": "high", "shares_lines_with": []}, {"id": 47, "kind": "claim", "lines": [[74, 74]], "assertion": "mean number of games per dyad was 2.9 (range 1-47)", "polarity": "found", "targets": ["number of games"], "confidence": "high", "shares_lines_with": []}, {"id": 48, "kind": "nonclaim", "subtype": "other", "lines": [[75, 75]], "note": "blank line"}, {"id": 49, "kind": "claim", "lines": [[76, 77]], "assertion": "yellow cards received in the dyad was included as a continuous covariate, as a proxy for aggressive play or referee strictness", "polarity": "did", "targets": ["yellow cards", "covariate"], "confidence": "high", "shares_lines_with": []}, {"id": 50, "kind": "claim", "lines": [[78, 78]], "assertion": "mean yellow cards per dyad was 0.4", "polarity": "found", "targets": ["yellow cards"], "confidence": "high", "shares_lines_with": []}, {"id": 51, "kind": "nonclaim", "subtype": "other", "lines": [[79, 79]], "note": "blank line"}, {"id": 52, "kind": "claim", "lines": [[80, 81]], "assertion": "goals scored in the dyad was included as a continuous covariate, as a proxy for playing time and offensive involvement", "polarity": "did", "targets": ["goals", "covariate"], "confidence": "high", "shares_lines_with": []}, {"id": 53, "kind": "claim", "lines": [[82, 82]], "assertion": "mean goals per dyad was 0.36", "polarity": "found", "targets": ["goals"], "confidence": "high", "shares_lines_with": []}, {"id": 54, "kind": "nonclaim", "subtype": "other", "lines": [[83, 83]], "note": "blank line"}, {"id": 55, "kind": "claim", "lines": [[84, 86]], "assertion": "player position (Goalkeeper reference, Defender, Midfielder, Forward, Other, Unknown) was included as a categorical covariate since positions differ in foul rates", "polarity": "did", "targets": ["position", "covariate"], "confidence": "high", "shares_lines_with": []}, {"id": 56, "kind": "claim", "lines": [[87, 87]], "assertion": "de